sequenceDiagram
    box Aqua Mobile clients
        actor Rider
        participant App as Rider app
    end
    box rgba(255, 240, 200, 0.6) Dispatch
        participant Dispatch
        participant Driver
    end

    Rider->>App: Request a ride
    Note right of Rider: The pickup pin is <br/>dragged before sending
    App->>Dispatch: POST /rides
    Note over Dispatch,Driver: Dispatch holds the offer for 15s
    Dispatch->>Driver: Offer ride 4471
    Driver-->>Dispatch: accepted
    Note left of Driver: Declining releases the offer to the next driver
    Dispatch-->>App: driver assigned, ETA 4 min
